xterm charsets.h
----------------

This project includes generated data derived from xterm's character set
tables (charsets.h), and a copy of that file as the generator's input.

The generated data is used in: src/term/charset_pages.zig
The input is: tools/xterm/charsets.h

Upstream project:
https://invisible-island.net/xterm/

Upstream revision:
xterm-snapshots 5c75ead9a75d4b2e666ca06fa94503b5766ed93f (xterm-412),
charsets.h,v 1.36 2025/04/08

Source:
https://github.com/ThomasDickey/xterm-snapshots/blob/5c75ead9a75d4b2e666ca06fa94503b5766ed93f/charsets.h

